<title>CHILE: TABLE-Chile's Santa Isabel 1H net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Chile's Santa Isabel 1H net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean supermarket chain Santa Isabel SA reported the following results in the first six months of the year.</p>
<p>				1H 1997	  1H 1996</p>
<p> Net profit		   4.73   profit  4.49</p>
<p> Operating profit	   5.48   profit  4.23</p>
<p> Non-operating loss	 0.22   profit  0.76</p>
<p> Total sales		100.78	    80.93</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>(( --Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595X212))</p>
